          "snapshot_text_sha256": "d3ae45adef44ff7e50c5af2f72fcf6f43707c6087d10ffff0daca7fb6319333b",
          "normalized_text": "Void Ability Kills grant Devour. Devour becomes Enhanced Devour. Enhanced Devour: Restores 140 HP on activation and grants Enhanced Devour for 10+5 seconds. Reactivating Enhanced Devour restores 140 HP and refreshes 5+3 seconds. Scoring a kill while Enhanced Devour is active restores 140 HP, grants doubled Grenade Ability Energy, and refreshes 5+3 seconds of its duration. Grenade Ability Energy on Kill: Tier 1 Combatant = 15% | T2 = 23.2% | T3 = 27.5% | T4 = 40% | Guardians = 40%",
          "matches_snapshot": true
        }
      ]
    },
