          "snapshot_text_sha256": "38565e73b023ff2ddfd857e22f335bdd2018ddee0df2c2ec99aae4812d8cb3ec",
          "normalized_text": "Grants Enhanced Devour upon scoring an Ability Kill, Frozen Enemy Shatter Kill, Volatile Explosion Kill, or a Tangle Kill. Devour becomes Enhanced Devour. Enhanced Devour: Restores 140 HP on activation and grants Enhanced Devour for 10 seconds. Reactivating Enhanced Devour restores 140 HP and refreshes 5 seconds. Scoring a kill while Enhanced Devour is active restores 140 HP, grants doubled Grenade Ability Energy, and refreshes 5 seconds of its duration. Grenade Ability Energy on Kill: Tier 1 Combatant = 15% | T2 = 23.2% | T3 = 27.5% | T4 = 40% | Guardians = 40%",
          "matches_snapshot": true
        }
